  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Sudan 2025 &#x2013; WHO WASH Lead</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan is currently experiencing a complex emergency with massive movement of people due to the ongoing conflict. The risk of spreading communicable diseases is very high especially in settlements of the internally displaces persons and in other non-affected sates given the sub optimal living conditions and constrained access to health care, nutrition, WASH and environmental health interventions. The water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) team lead will support the Sudan World Health Organization (WHO) country office to respont to the current outbreaks and contribute to minimizing national wide spread through preparedness efforts in collaboration with relevant clusters.</narrative>
  </description>
